        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ugly Kid Joe\n- Groups: rap group behind \"Shake a Lil' Somethin'\"\n- Albums: As Ugly as They Wanna Be, Shake a Lil' Somethin', As Nasty as They Wanna Be\n- Songs: Everything About You\n\nFacts:\n- In winter 1991, Ugly Kid Joe released the album \"As Ugly as They Wanna Be.\"\n- The song \"Everything About You\" appears on \"As Ugly as They Wanna Be.\"\n- \"As Ugly as They Wanna Be\" is a parody of the 1989 album \"As Nasty as They Wanna Be.\"\n- The rap group 2 Live Crew released its seventh studio album \"Shake a Lil' Somethin'.\"",
